<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->
When `hasActiveSessionsOnCurrentHead()` returns an error, the condition `err == nil && hasActive` evaluates to false, causing the safety check to be bypassed entirely. The error is silently swallowed and the reset proceeds to the confirmation prompt. If the error was due to inability to list sessions, active session data could be reset while still in use.
