**Low Severity**

<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->
`handleGeminiSessionEnd` uses `strategy.FindMostRecentSession()` to find the session to mark as ended. This replaced file-based tracking via `paths.ReadCurrentSession()`. However, `FindMostRecentSession()` returns whichever session has the most recent `LastInteractionTime` across all agents, not specifically the Gemini session that triggered this hook. In concurrent multi-session scenarios (e.g., user running both Gemini and Claude Code sessions), this could mark the wrong session as ended.
<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->

